ialist CSA02815P SDSU- Animal Science CSA 09/18/2026 South Dakota State University (SDState) is currently seeking an Information Specialist to join our Animal Science department. This position will play a critical role in the department’s three primary missions which are learning, discovery, and engagement. If you have a strong attention to detail and excellent writing, editing and proofreading skills then this position may be for you!Tomorrow’s ... View Details Bookmark Instructor of Communication Studies F01942P NSU-Arts & Sciences Faculty Position Summary: The Department of English, Communication, and Global Languages at Northern State University invites applications for a full-time, non-tenure-track Instructor of Communication Studies. This instructor-rank position offers the opportunity to shape the foundational communication and first-year experience of NSU students through engaged teaching and active involvement in departmen... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of History F01941P NSU-History Faculty Position Summary: The Department of History and Social Sciences at Northern State University invites applications for a full-time, tenure-track Assistant Professor of History. This position offers the opportunity to teach and mentor students in Early American History through the Civil War era while contributing to the department’s research culture and to university life more broadly. The antici... View Details Bookmark Carpenter - Senior Building Maintenance Worker CSA02814P SDSU-Facilities & Services-Bldg Maint CSA South Dakota State University is seeking a skilled and highly motivated Carpenter – Senior Building Maintenance Worker to join our Facilities and Services team. This position is ideal for an individual who takes pride in quality craftsmanship, enjoys hands-on work, and is committed to maintaining and improving the university’s facilities. This position is located in Brookings, South Dakota.Faci... View Details Bookmark Program Assistant I CSA02